'''Moe Uzumasa & Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was implemented in [[Version 7.0 Update|Version 7.0]] and can be obtained during the [[Get On! Kyoto City Subway Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 422
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Moe Uzumasa & Cat
|name2 = Moe Uzumasa & Cat CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Moe Uzumasa & Cat CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This duo of Cat and anime girl unfortunately has no meaning or use in the game other than to boost [[User Rank]]. The best it can do is offer some support in early [[Empire of Cats]] stages like [[Korea (Empire of Cats)|Korea]] or [[Japan (Empire of Cats)|Japan]], as it will falter and die at any real threat, like [[J.K. Bun Bun|J.K. Bun Bun]]. Unfortunately, no amount of boost will save it from this fate either, as they have too low base stats.

{{Job|Classification = User Rank Dump}}

